{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"frank-grillo","name":"Frank Grillo","birthDate":"1965-06-08","birthPlace":"New York City, New York, USA","bio":"Frank Anthony Grillo (born June 8, 1965) is an American actor. He is known for playing Brock Rumlow/Crossbones in three superhero films and one series of the Marvel Cinematic Universe (MCU), Sergeant Leo Barnes in two action-horror films within The Purge franchise, and Rick Flag Sr. in the DC Universe (DCU). He has also appeared in Warrior (2011), The Grey (2012), End of Watch (2012), Zero Dark Thirty (2012), Wolf Warrior 2 and Wheelman (both 2017), and Boss Level (2021).\n\nGrillo's television work includes the lead role in Kingdom (2014–2017) and recurring roles in Battery Park (2000), For the People (2002–2003), The Shield (2002–2003), Prison Break (2005–2006), Blind Justice (2005), The Kill Point (2007), and Billions (2020).\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Frank Grillo, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:37:24+00:00","tmdbId":81685,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/81685","credits":[{"id":"cap-winter","title":"Captain America: The Winter Soldier","character":"Brock Rumlow"},{"id":"civil-war","title":"Captain America: Civil War","character":"Brock Rumlow / Crossbones","characterFa":"براک راملو / کراس‌بونز"},{"id":"whatif-2","title":"What If...? — Season 2","character":"Brock Rumlow"},{"id":"whatif-3","title":"What If...? — Season 3","character":"Brock Rumlow"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/frank-grillo.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Man of Tomorrow","year":2027,"character":"Rick Flag Sr.","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tYLgfKk3cEk7LskgxWyW37Nty01.jpg"},{"name":"Kill Code","year":2026,"character":"Benjamin","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bXvSKLCillha6wxY0yxoRCM2WQl.jpg"},{"name":"Misdirection","year":2026,"character":"David Blume","mediaType":"movie","poster